        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.mtvernonoh.gov/201/About-the-City"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Mount Vernon hosts the annual Knox County Fair in July and the Mount Vernon Music and Arts Festival in August, drawing regional crowds.",
